cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DEAPack in research, please cite the software version you used.
  The companion book, Data Envelopment Analysis: Efficiency, Productivity,
  and Environmental Performance with Python, is a separate scholarly work
  and will receive its own citation after archival publication.
title: DEAPack
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Daoping
    email: daopingwang@outlook.com
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for DEA-based efficiency, productivity, environmental,
  network, dynamic, and related production-performance analysis.
keywords:
  - data envelopment analysis
  - efficiency analysis
  - productivity analysis
  - environmental performance
  - production economics
license: GPL-3.0-only
